I'll help you enhance the DailyChart component to display all the metrics from the data object with the ability to toggle visibility using labels on the right.

```vue client/src/components/analytics/DailyChart.vue
<script setup>
import { ref } from 'vue'
</script>

<template>
  <div class="w-full h-full flex flex-col gap-4">
